ATTRIBUTION & CREDITS

OpenClaw was designed and built by Manus (https://manus.im/)

This project integrates with and builds upon:

1. PAPERCLIP (https://github.com/paperclipai/paperclip)
   - Open-source business OS for autonomous AI companies
   - Used for agent coordination and task management
   - Please see Paperclip's license for terms

2. OLLAMA (https://github.com/ollama/ollama)
   - Local and cloud LLM infrastructure
   - Licensed under MIT License
   - https://github.com/ollama/ollama/blob/main/LICENSE

3. OPENROUTER (https://openrouter.ai/)
   - Model aggregation platform
   - Commercial API service

4. REACT (https://react.dev)
   - UI framework
   - Licensed under MIT License

5. TAILWIND CSS (https://tailwindcss.com)
   - Utility-first CSS framework
   - Licensed under MIT License

6. EXPRESS.JS (https://expressjs.com)
   - Web framework
   - Licensed under MIT License

7. tRPC (https://trpc.io)
   - Type-safe APIs
   - Licensed under MIT License

8. DRIZZLE ORM (https://orm.drizzle.team)
   - Database ORM
   - Licensed under Apache 2.0 License

When using OpenClaw, please ensure you comply with the licenses of all
dependencies and give appropriate credit to:

- Manus (https://manus.im) - Design and development
- Paperclip team - Open-source business OS
- Ollama team - LLM infrastructure
- All open-source contributors

